 "method": {
  "to_date": "Yahoo's week totals (get_matchups through Flaim, the morning pull); the box-score rebuild is the cross-check",
  "rebuild": "a day with Yahoo's pinned lineup counts its active slots (not BN, IL or IL+); any other day counts every non-IL player on today's roster who played, ten per day by the daily-fill rule when more played; each day's source is in rebuild_rosters",
  "projection": "season-pool per-game line x each remaining game x today's status availability; ten-slot daily fill; IL counts 0",
  "percentages": "total makes / total attempts, actual plus projected",
  "drop": "no game left this week and board value below the active roster's median",
  "chances": "P(win) per category: the normal approximation on the final totals; to date fixed, the remaining games' variance from the season per-game CV (FG%/FT%: binomial makes x PCT_MIX_INFL^2); the shared weekly shock left out",
  "this_week": "each free agent in place of the below-median player whose drop helps most, from tomorrow; ranked by the change in expected categories won (the sum of the nine changes in P(win)); season cost = the change in expected weekly categories against the other eleven teams",
  "pickups": "Yahoo's available-player list (100 listed, Yahoo-wide ownership order), each from today on at his Yahoo letter's availability, ranked by projected category wins gained, then gap closed"
 },
